WEBVTT

00:13:30.722 --> 00:13:32.850
It's a win for the environment.

00:13:32.891 --> 00:13:37.563
It's a win for all of these creatures
that have suffered so much at our hands.

00:13:39.398 --> 00:13:42.651
It’s a win for this
beautiful Earth of ours.

00:13:43.485 --> 00:13:44.820
As Carl Sagan once said,

00:13:45.863 --> 00:13:48.282
“The only Earth we’ll ever know.

00:13:49.241 --> 00:13:50.742
The only home we'll ever know."

00:13:52.369 --> 00:13:53.620
It's a win for us.

00:13:54.705 --> 00:13:57.040
We are taking this work

00:13:57.082 --> 00:14:02.045
in Africa to Liberia,
Cameroon, Kenya, South Africa.